	bool "CAPI DMA direct API (link-time binding)"
	depends on CAPI_DMA
	default n
	help
	  Bind capi_dma_* directly to the active platform driver via symbol
	  aliases instead of the ops-pointer dispatcher, and drop
	  capi/src/capi_dma.c. Safe because no-OS builds one platform per image.
	  Note: scatter-gather functions are excluded (not implemented on Maxim).

